Also note that we used `keys.add(ev.key)`, that includes 'Space' key which is `' '`? In keydown events for the space bar, ev.key returns `' '` (space character) or `'Space'`? Typically ev.key = ' ' (space). It may be `' '` (space char) or `'Space'` but we can handle `' '`.

